clueweb09-en0007-85-36505.240 and serve whenever hunger calls. Warm your way to spring with good friends, good food, and hearts full of hope. Publication Date: 8 January 2009 Dutchess Tourism Welcomes New Tour and Travel Manager Director of Dutchess County Tourism Mary Kay Vrba announces that Dawn Hopper of Kingston has joined the staff of Dutchess County Tourism as the tour and travel marketing manager. Prior to working at the tourism office, she held positions as senior sales manager at the Hudson Valley Resort & Spa, business development manager at Eisenhower Hall Theatre at the U.S. Military Academy at West Point and director of sales for Broadway producers Dodger Theatricals in New York City. Publication Date: 23 December 2008 Tourism Information Center at Vassar College Finding out about things to see and do in Dutchess just got easier. Spend less time planning and more time sightseeing by visiting the new Tourism Information Center
