clueweb09-en0007-85-36487.360 million annually on print, radio and television advertising, making them a dominant portal of New York tourism. Partners with Hudson Valley Tourism , Inc. They spend $150,000 annually on print advertising, effectively increasing traffic to DutchessTourism.com Our five print publications, totaling 675,000 issues, carry our website address. DutchessTourism.com is the official I Love New York, Dutchess County Tourism website, carrying a great deal of credibility among the traveling public. In 2007 there were over 682,221 visits to DutchessTourism.com , an average of more then 56,852 visits/month, peaking in November with 70,847 visits. The average visitor viewed more then 5 pages/visit. The banners of our website sponsors were seen an average of more then 5,276 times per day. Of the U.S. Internet users, 78 percent turned to the Internet for travel or destination information in 2005. Almost half of online planners use destination websites such as those maintained by convention and
