clueweb09-en0007-85-36499.0 Search Events Calendar: Search Events by Location: All Amenia Annandale-on-Hudson Beacon Beekman Clinton Corners Dover Plains Fishkill Germantown Hopewell Junction Hyde Park LaGrange Lagrangeville Millbrook Millerton Pawling Pine Plains Pleasant Valley Poughkeepsie Poughquag Red Hook Rhinebeck Staatsburg Stanford Stormville Tivoli Wappingers Falls Wassaic Wingdale Find Lodging Packages Meetings & Events Group Tours Press Room Advertise With Us Contact DCT About DCT Home Photo courtesy of Troubeck What if you get more than you expect? Convention Center Creative Meeting Sites Hotel Sites Catering Venues Located midway between New York City and Albany, Dutchess County combines elegance and style with travel convenience to provide the ideal site for meetings and conferences. We offer a complete range of conference services at our full-service hotels and quaint country inns, complemented by year-round outdoor activities, wineries, historical attractions and fun for the entire family. Enjoy spectacular views of the Hudson River and Catskill Mountains –
clueweb09-en0007-85-36499.120 hotels and quaint country inns, complemented by year-round outdoor activities, wineries, historical attractions and fun for the entire family. Enjoy spectacular views of the Hudson River and Catskill Mountains – you’ll get more than you expect in Dutchess County! SERVICES PROVIDED BY DUTCHESS COUNTY TOURISM OFFICE & STAFF “WHAT IF YOU GET MORE THAN YOU EXPECT?” This is our motto in Dutchess County and that of our meeting and conference facilities located here. At Dutchess County Tourism the staff is ready and eager to help you with planning a successful event. They are very knowledgeable about the county and additional services you may need. From the planning stage through the completion of the event, we want to make your event the best ever. Send us your requirements. We will see that they get to the facilities that will tailor a proposal just for you. Provide alternative and creative meeting locations
clueweb09-en0007-85-36499.240 the best ever. Send us your requirements. We will see that they get to the facilities that will tailor a proposal just for you. Provide alternative and creative meeting locations in historic buildings and public spaces. Coordinate with individual site inspections of meeting facilities, attractions and points of interest. Provide comprehensive presentations for your consideration. Provide quantities of the Dutchess County Travel Guide for use in pre-convention mailings. Use of Dutchess County Tourism video for presentation to decision makers, and delegates. Provide color slides, maps, directions and logos for reproduction in your meeting materials, promotional flyers or pre-mailers. Provide community relations assistance in developing contacts and promoting your event. Develop spouse or guest tours and activities. Provide customized welcome letter from appropriate government officials for inclusion in your registration materials. About DCT | Advertise with Us | Contact Us | Privacy Policy | Terms of Use | Home (C) 2006
clueweb09-en0007-85-36499.360 from appropriate government officials for inclusion in your registration materials. About DCT | Advertise with Us | Contact Us | Privacy Policy | Terms of Use | Home (C) 2006 Dutchess County Tourism. All rights reserved. Dutchess County Tourism, 3 Neptune Rd. Suite Q-17, Poughkeepsie NY 12601 Tel: 845/463-4000 or 800/445-3131 The programs provided by this agency are partially funded by monies received from the County of Dutchess.
