clueweb09-en0005-00-32675.120 . Schools . Tourism . Community . Elected Officials Text Size: [Normal Text Size] [Large Text Size] Give Us Your Input Dutchess County Website Survey In order to make the Dutchess County website more accessible and user-friendly, we are requesting your feedback. Please take a few moments to complete this brief on-line survey--your comments and suggestions will better help us to serve you. I can easily find what Im looking for on the Dutchess County website. Strongly Agree Agree Disagree Strongly Disagree The Dutchess County website is visually appealing and has good design. Strongly Agree Agree Disagree Strongly Disagree For those having a disability or impairment, the Dutchess County website is very accessible. Strongly Agree Agree Disagree Strongly Disagree N/A Please select all of the following sections and features of the Dutchess County website that are important to you. All Services Directory County Government Municipality Business Schools Tourism/Recreation Community Elected
